            "Find it with Google\u2019s Place ID finder: search for your business and copy the ID.": [
                "Megkereshet\u0151 a Google Place ID keres\u0151j\u00e9vel: keress\u00fcnk r\u00e1 a v\u00e1llalkoz\u00e1sra, \u00e9s m\u00e1soljuk ki az azonos\u00edt\u00f3t."
