            "An API key from your Google Cloud project with the Places API (New) enabled. Restrict it to that API.": [
                "Egy API-kulcs a Google Cloud projektb\u0151l, amelyben enged\u00e9lyezve van a Places API (New). Korl\u00e1tozzuk erre az API-ra."
            ],
            "Business unit ID": [
